THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS AND ATTRIBUTION
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This software integrates the following third-party frameworks, libraries, and
pre-trained model architectures. Each is governed by its own separate license
and all rights remain with their respective authors:

  - PyTorch (BSD-style license)      https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch
  - PennyLane (Apache 2.0)           https://github.com/PennyLaneAI/pennylane
  - timm / pytorch-image-models      https://github.com/huggingface/pytorch-image-models
    (Apache 2.0)
  - ConvNeXt-V2 architecture         https://github.com/facebookresearch/ConvNeXt-V2
    (CC BY-NC 4.0 — non-commercial use; original ImageNet weights)
  - DenseNet-121 architecture        https://github.com/liuzhuang13/DenseNets
    (originally described in: Huang et al., CVPR 2017)
  - FastAPI (MIT)                    https://github.com/tiangolo/fastapi
  - Albumentations (MIT)             https://github.com/albumentations-team/albumentations
