-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DATASET AND CLINICAL DATA NOTICE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The model checkpoints distributed alongside this software (.pth files) were
trained on a multi-center clinical oral mucosal photography dataset. This
dataset is NOT included in this repository and is NOT redistributed under
this license. All patient data was handled under institutional ethics review
and applicable data-protection regulations. No patient-identifiable
information is encoded in the model weights.

This software does NOT claim ownership over any third-party dataset,
pre-trained feature extractor weights, or external benchmark data.

